# Review ownership.
#
# The design-system maintainers own everything that reaches a customer: the
# published packages, the registry source, the tokens, and the pipeline that
# generates the rest. A change to any of those is an API change whether or not
# it looks like one.

*                               @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers

# Shipped source — always a maintainer review.
/packages/core/                 @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/packages/react/                @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/packages/loaders/              @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/packages/tokens/               @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/packages/fhir/                 @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/registry/                      @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers

# The generator decides what the registry, the docs, and the type paths contain.
/scripts/gen/                   @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers

# Architecture invariants and the contribution standard.
/ENGINEERING.md                 @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/ARCHITECTURE.md                @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/CONTENT.md                     @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/content/decisions/             @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers

# Supply chain and release. A change here changes what ships and who can ship it.
/.github/workflows/             @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/.changeset/config.json         @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/package.json                   @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/pnpm-lock.yaml                 @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
/SECURITY.md                    @zoworkhq/zoblocks-maintainers
